// DEMO_LVGL.c (refactored full file)
// - Fixes duplicate/stacking activity callbacks
// - Fixes implicit declaration ordering issues
// - Keeps touch polling timer (best reliability for Settings screen / scrollables)
// - Attaches activity_event_cb ONCE per screen (when the screen is built)
// - Removes re-attaching activity cb every ui_show()

